# Browsers that we support
# (Config helps => https://github.com/browserslist/browserslist)
#
# `defaults` is browserslist's recommended list: > 0.5% usage, the last 2 versions of each browser,
# Firefox ESR, and no browsers that are "dead" (no updates for 24 months).
# PostCSS (postcss-preset-env) reads this list to decide which CSS fallbacks and prefixes to add.
# Run `npm run audit:browser-support` to see the browsers it currently includes.

